SF0182 Property tax valuation-fair market value.
Sponsored By: Senator(s) Dockstader and Representative(s) Erickson
AN ACT relating to property taxation; revising the definition of fair market
value to include replacement cost new less depreciation for specified property;
making conforming amendments; requiring rulemaking; and providing for effective
dates.
